# JavaScript and JSX are always text, and must always diff as text.
#
# src/utils/crochetTerms.js was committed with a raw NUL byte on line 167, used
# as a separator inside a Map key. Git treats any file with a NUL in its first
# 8000 bytes as binary, so a 585-line engine landed in the history as
# "Bin 0 -> 30882 bytes" and could not be reviewed in a diff at all. The byte is
# gone, and the `diff` attribute below makes sure a future one cannot hide a
# change to this code again.
#
# Only the `diff` attribute is set. Nothing here touches line endings or
# checkout behaviour, so no file is renormalised by adding it.
*.js   diff
*.jsx  diff
*.mjs  diff
*.cjs  diff
*.json diff
*.css  diff
*.html diff
